 "intro_zh": "金鸡湖景区位于苏州工业园区金鸡湖商务区，景区拥有“苏州中心”“东方之门”“音乐喷泉”“金鸡湖大桥”“文化艺术中心”“月光码头”“诚品书店”“国金中心”“望湖角”“李公堤”十大景观。",
 "intro_en": "Jinji Lake (Chinese: 金鸡湖; pinyin: Jīnjī Hú) is a fresh water lake located in the central part of Suzhou Industrial Park, Jiangsu, China. It occupies an area of 7.18 square kilometers (2.77 sq mi) and its average depth is about 2.5–3 meters (8 ft 2 in – 9 ft 10 in). There are two man-made islands in the lake. The Suzhou Culture and Arts Centre, which houses the Jinji Lake Art Museum, is located prominently on the shore of the lake.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
